36. Where Does Every Variable Go?

This is the table you should memorize.

Variable type	Example	Runtime storage
Instance variable primitive	int age = 20;	Heap, inside object
Instance variable reference	String name = "Shobhit";	Heap, inside object
Static variable	static int count = 10;	Class-level/static storage; simplified as Method Area
Local primitive	int x = 50;	Stack frame
Local reference	String city = "Delhi";	Stack frame
Parameter primitive	int marks	Stack frame
Parameter reference	Student s	Stack frame
Object	new Student()	Heap
Method code	display()	Method Area/class-level runtime data
Current instruction	currently executing instruction	PC Register
